                  {
                    "value": "What this analysis measures\nObserved favorite-display movement among eligible repeatedly tracked listings in a sampled 20-day window. Exact displays are primary; compact/rounded displays appear only in sensitivity analysis.\n\nWhat it does NOT establish\nSales or revenue growth • orders or conversion • customer demand • platform-wide category growth or market share • campaign effectiveness • future performance.\n\nSampling limits\nOnly a minority of products repeat; daily sampling is uneven; 10 categories have insufficient evidence and remain N/A/unranked.",
